# The project spec lives in .claude/skills and is versioned. Machine-local
# settings are not, and neither are the generic skills, which are reinstallable.
# `.claude/*` instead of `.claude/`: Git does not descend into an ignored
# directory, so a negation below it would never apply.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
.claude/skills/laravel-best-practices/
.claude/skills/pest-testing/
.claude/skills/tailwindcss-development/

# The two instruction files at the root of .github are versioned; the mirror of
# generic skills next to them is not.
.github/skills/